{"type":"step-attempt","step":"design","sessionId":"aa3d084c-8b3b-4ec2-b852-8af02d97afca","outcome":{"verdict":"success","findingsPath":null,"error":null,"toolResult":{"ok":true,"reason":"Wrote design.md, spec.md, tasks.md under specrunner/changes/noop-detect-finding-target-exemption/ for the no-op finding-target exemption change.\n\nDesign summary:\n- D1: Add a pure `collectRoutedFixerFindings(state)` in a new light module `src/core/step/routed-findings.ts` that mirrors code-fixer.buildMessage's routing precedence (conformance → coordinator-loop → active-reviewer), reusing existing state seams (getConformanceFixContext / collectParallelFixerFindings / getLatestJudgeFindings / resolveActiveReviewer / deriveImplFixerChain). Relocate the private predicates isCoordinatorLoopActive / getNeedsFixMembers from code-fixer.ts into this module (behavior unchanged) so both code-fixer and the executor share the same routing predicates — the exemption set is faithfully \"findings routed to THIS run\" (not a superset → no sabotage fail-open; not a subset → no false escalation). New module is import-cycle-safe and keeps agent/prompt deps out of executor's graph; reviewer-chain.ts rejected because CUSTOM_REVIEWERS_STEP_NAME would create a reviewer-chain↔pipeline/types cycle. Agent self-report is not an input.\n- D2: detectNoOp gains optional findingTargetPaths + pipelineManagedPaths params. sourceFiles filter exempts finding-named paths from ARTIFACT_PREFIXES, but subtracts pipelineManagedPaths inside the detector (exempt = findingTargetPaths − pipelineManagedPaths) so the cap tooth is local. Params default to empty → prior behavior byte-identical.\n- D3: executor computes findingTargetPaths only when step.noOpDetect===true (guard) and passes pipelineManagedPaths(deps.slug); findingsRoutingApproved / completionReason / sourceFiles>0 paths unchanged.\n\ntasks.md T-01..T-05 cover the module + code-fixer refactor, detectNoOp, executor wiring, and the four acceptance-criteria scenario tests (#927 doc exemption, non-target change-folder file → needs-fix, pipelineManagedPaths cap → needs-fix, src-only normal case) plus existing-test preservation and typecheck+test. No src/ edits performed — planning only.","status":"success"},"followUpAttempts":0,"transientRetryAttempts":0,"addedTurns":{"reportRetry":0,"postWork":0,"outputRepair":0}},"startedAt":"2026-08-01T10:00:13.378Z","endedAt":"2026-08-01T10:12:45.396Z","commitOid":"194a423665e734ff1e8cf5f54ca72ff3bdeab634"}
